<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>针刺方法 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E9%92%88%E5%88%BA%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 30 Sep 2025 08:55:11 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E9%92%88%E5%88%BA%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>邪客第七十一</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-71/</link><pubDate>Tue, 30 Sep 2025 08:55:11 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-71/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%81%B5%E6%9E%A2/">灵枢</category><description>邪客，是指邪气侵犯人体。本篇以邪气侵犯人体后所形成的失眠证为主，论述了相关内容，所以篇名为&amp;quot;邪客&amp;quot;。</description></item><item><title>忧恚无言第六十九</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-69/</link><pubDate>Sun, 28 Sep 2025 13:25:11 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-69/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%81%B5%E6%9E%A2/">灵枢</category><description>忧恚，就是忧恨忿怒。无言，是指失音证。因为本篇主要论述了由情志内伤所导致的一时性失音证及其治疗，所以篇名为&amp;quot;忧患无言&amp;quot;。</description></item><item><title>上膈第六十八</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-68/</link><pubDate>Sat, 27 Sep 2025 08:55:11 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-68/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%81%B5%E6%9E%A2/">灵枢</category><description>上，是逆而上行，膈，为饮食不下。主要论述了膈食证的病因、病理、证候表现和治疗方法，因文章以&amp;quot;气为上膈&amp;quot;名篇，所以名为&amp;quot;上膈&amp;quot;。</description></item><item><title>行针第六十七</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-67/</link><pubDate>Fri, 26 Sep 2025 18:28:11 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-67/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%81%B5%E6%9E%A2/">灵枢</category><description>行针，一是指针刺治疗的全过程，二是指针刺后运针。因为本篇主要论述了由于人的体质不同，针刺后的反应也不同，以及针刺操作正确与否同疗效的关系等针刺有关问题，故篇名为&amp;quot;行针&amp;quot;。</description></item></channel></rss>